concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":1,"lift":0.34,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","dsc":0,"cul":1,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":3,"lift":3.25,"evidence_tier":"sparse"},{"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":7,"lift":0.75,"evidence_tier":"studied"},{"concept_id":"wounds","dsc":1,"cul":0,"persistent":false,"epmc_pair":20,"lift":1.93,"evidence_tier":"studied"}],"lead_score":0.5383},"texts":{"dsc:2.124":{"ref":"De materia medica 2.124","headword":"ἀνδράχνη δύναμιν ἔχει","lang":"grc","source":"dioscorides","text":"ἀνδράχνη δύναμιν ἔχει στυπτικήν, ψυκτικήν. καταπλασσομένη δὲ μετʼ ἀλφίτου βοηθεῖ κεφαλῆς ἀλγήμασι καὶ ὀφθαλμῶν φλεγμοναῖς καὶ ταῖς ἄλλαις καὶ στομάχου πυρώσει καὶ ἐρυσιπέλατι καὶ κύστεως ἀλγήματι. βρωθεῖσα δὲ αἱμωδίαν καὶ στομάχου καὶ ἐντέρων πύρωσιν καὶ ῥευματισμὸν πραύνει, νεφρούς τε δακνομένους καὶ κύστιν εὖ διατίθησι καὶ τὰς πρὸς συνουσίαν ὁρμὰς ἐκλύει. παραπλησίως δὲ καὶ ὁ χυλὸς αὐτῆς ἐνεργεῖ πινόμενος καὶ ἐν πυρετοῖς ποιῶν, καὶ πρὸς ἕλμεις στρογγύλας καὶ αἵματος πτύσιν καὶ δυσενἀνδράχνη τερίαν καὶ πρὸς αἱμορροίδα καὶ πρὸς σηπὸς δήγματα. καὶ εἰς τὰ ὀφθαλμικὰ δὲ χρησίμως μείγνυται, ἔγκλυσμά τέ ἐστιν ἐντέρων ῥευματιζομένων καὶ ὀδαξωμένης μήτρας, καὶ πρὸς τὰς ἐξ ἐγκαύσεως κεφαλαλγίας σὺν ῥοδίνῳ ἐλαίῳ ἔμβρεγμα, πρός τε τὰ ἐν κεφαλῇ ἐξανθήματα σὺν οἴνῳ σμῆγμα, πρὸς τραύματα δὲ σφακελίζοντα σὺν ἀλφίτοις καταπλασσόμενος.","spans":[{"start":81,"end":92,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":102,"end":116,"concept_id":"conjunctivitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":111,"end":118,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":142,"end":154,"concept_id":"dyspepsia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":163,"end":171,"concept_id":"erysipelas","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":179,"end":186,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":276,"end":283,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":303,"end":309,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":336,"end":343,"concept_id":"sexual_function","polarity":"action"},{"start":418,"end":426,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":443,"end":449,"concept_id":"helminthiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":465,"end":477,"concept_id":"hemoptysis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":514,"end":523,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":560,"end":566,"concept_id":"eye_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":649,"end":655,"concept_id":"uterine_disorders","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":683,"end":694,"concept_id":"headache","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":743,"end":750,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":776,"end":782,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"}]},"cul:243-purslain":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Purslain","headword":"Purslain","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"’Tis an herb of the Moon. It is good to cool any heat in the liver, blood, reins, and stomach, and in hot agues nothing better: It stays hot and choleric fluxes of the belly, women’s courses, the whites, and gonorrhæa, or running of the reins, the distillation from the head, and pains therein proceeding from heat, want of sleep, or the frenzy. The seed is more effectual than the herb, and is of singular good use to cool the heat and sharpness of urine, venereous dreams, and the like; insomuch that the over frequent use hereof extinguishes the heat and virtue of natural procreation. The seed bruised and boiled in wine, and given to children, expels the worms. The juice of the herb is held as effectual to all the purposes aforesaid; as also to stay vomitings, and taken with some sugar or honey, helps an old and dry cough, shortness of breath, and the phthisick, and stays immoderate thirst. The distilled water of the herb is used by many (as the more pleasing) with a little sugar to work the same effects. The juice also is singularly good in the inflammations and ulcers in the secret parts of man or woman, as also the bowels and hæmorrhoids, when they are ulcerous, or excoriations in them. The herb bruised and applied to the forehead and temples, allays excessive heat therein, that hinders rest and sleep; and applied to the eyes, takes away the redness and inflammation in them, and those other parts where pushes, wheals, pimples, St. Anthony’s fire and the like, break forth; if a little vinegar be put to it, and laid to the neck, with as much of galls and linseed together, it takes away the pains therein, and the crick in the neck. The juice is used with oil of roses for the same causes, or for blasting by lightning, and burnings by gunpowder, or for women’s sore breasts, and to allay the heat in all other sores or hurts; applied also to the navels of children that stick forth, it helps them; it is also good for sore mouths and gums that are swollen, and to fasten loose teeth. Camerarius saith, the distilled water used by some, took away the pain of their teeth, when all other remedies failed, and the thickened juice made into pills with the powder of gum Tragicanth and Arabic, being taken, prevails much to help those that make bloody water. Applied to the gout it eases pains thereof, and helps the hardness of the sinews, if it come not of the cramp, or a cold cause.","spans":[{"start":49,"end":66,"concept_id":"liver_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":75,"end":80,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":106,"end":111,"concept_id":"fever","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":131,"end":190,"concept_id":"menorrhagia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":196,"end":202,"concept_id":"leukorrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":248,"end":260,"concept_id":"common_cold","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":316,"end":329,"concept_id":"insomnia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":338,"end":344,"concept_id":"delirium","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":437,"end":455,"concept_id":"dysuria","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":457,"end":473,"concept_id":"sexual_function","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":660,"end":665,"concept_id":"helminthiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":757,"end":766,"concept_id":"nausea_vomiting","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":825,"end":830,"concept_id":"cough","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":832,"end":851,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":861,"end":870,"concept_id":"asthma_dyspnea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1059,"end":1072,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1077,"end":1083,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1144,"end":1155,"concept_id":"hemorrhoids","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1171,"end":1179,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1300,"end":1312,"concept_id":"insomnia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1376,"end":1388,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1426,"end":1432,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1434,"end":1440,"concept_id":"dermatitis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1442,"end":1449,"concept_id":"skin_blemishes","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1455,"end":1469,"concept_id":"erysipelas","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1638,"end":1643,"concept_id":"convulsions","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1748,"end":1756,"concept_id":"burns","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1786,"end":1798,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1835,"end":1840,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1943,"end":1954,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1959,"end":1963,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":1989,"end":2007,"concept_id":"mouth_gums","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":2294,"end":2298,"concept_id":"gout","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"dsc:2.124":{"81":"pain / heaviness of the head","102":"inflammation of the eyes","111":"inflammations (φλεγμοναί)","142":"stomach painful / burning / fluxing / relaxed","163":"erysipelas","179":"bladder (κύστις)","276":"kidneys / nephritics (νεφριτικοί)","303":"bladder (κύστις)","336":"sexual intercourse (συνουσία)","418":"fevers (πυρετοί)","443":"intestinal worms (ἕλμινθες)","465":"bringing up / spitting of blood","514":"haemorrhoids (αἱμορροΐδες)","560":"the eyes; eye-salves (ὀφθαλμικά)","649":"the womb (ὑστέρα, μήτρα)","683":"headache (κεφαλαλγία, κεφαλαλγοῦντες)","743":"eruptions (ἐξανθήματα)","776":"wounds (τραύματα)"},"cul:243-purslain":{"49":"obstructions / heat of the liver","75":"reins: kidneys","106":"agues: intermittent fevers","131":"stays / stops women's courses, the terms","196":"the whites: leucorrhoea","248":"distillation / defluxion of rheum from the head: catarrh","316":"want of sleep: insomnia","338":"frenzy: delirium, raving","437":"heat / sharpness of urine; difficulty of making water","457":"venerous / veneral dreams: erotic dreams with emission","660":"worms (intestinal)","757":"stays vomiting / vomits","825":"cough, coughs","832":"shortness of breath: dyspnoea","861":"phthisic (here: tightness of breath / asthma)","1059":"inflammations","1077":"ulcers (old, foul, running, fretting)","1144":"haemorrhoids (hæmorrhoids, morrhoids)","1171":"ulcerous sores","1300":"heat that hinders rest and sleep","1376":"inflammations","1426":"pushes: pimples, pustules","1434":"wheals, weals: urticarial swellings","1442":"pimples","1455":"St. Anthony's fire: erysipelas","1638":"crick in the neck: muscular spasm","1748":"burnings","1786":"sore / swollen / hard breasts","1835":"sores, running sores","1943":"sore mouth","1959":"gums (sore, spongy, bleeding)","1989":"fastens loose teeth","2294":"gout","2383":"cramp, cramps"}},"images":["andrakhne-agria-37v-dioscoride-vienne"]}